/**
 * Spectral shaping
 * dt, sr          Duration and samplerate of the frame
 * scf_q           Quantized scale factors
 * inv             True on inverse shaping, False otherwise
 * x               Spectral coefficients
 * y               Return shapped coefficients
 *
 * `x` and `y` can be the same buffer
